  {
    "objectID": "modulos/st_02.html#respuestas-de-conteo",
    "href": "modulos/st_02.html#respuestas-de-conteo",
    "title": "3  Modelos lineales generalizados mixtos",
    "section": "4.4 Respuestas de conteo",
    "text": "4.4 Respuestas de conteo\n\n\nCódigo\nlibrary(lme4)\nlibrary(here)\n\ndatos &lt;- read.csv(here(\"datos\",\"mastitis.csv\"))\n\nmodelo &lt;- glmer(caso~mes+(1|granja),data=datos,family=binomial)\nsummary(modelo)\n\n\nGeneralized linear mixed model fit by maximum likelihood (Laplace\n  Approximation) [glmerMod]\n Family: binomial  ( logit )\nFormula: caso ~ mes + (1 | granja)\n   Data: datos\n\n      AIC       BIC    logLik -2*log(L)  df.resid \n   1104.1    1120.6    -549.0    1098.1      1797 \n\nScaled residuals: \n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-0.3280 -0.3217 -0.3155 -0.3094  3.2743 \n\nRandom effects:\n Groups Name        Variance Std.Dev.\n granja (Intercept) 0        0       \nNumber of obs: 1800, groups:  granja, 10\n\nFixed effects:\n            Estimate Std. Error z value Pr(&gt;|z|)    \n(Intercept) -2.21676    0.17207 -12.883   &lt;2e-16 ***\nmes         -0.01295    0.02374  -0.546    0.585    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 '***' 0.001 '**' 0.01 '*' 0.05 '.' 0.1 ' ' 1\n\nCorrelation of Fixed Effects:\n    (Intr)\nmes -0.879\noptimizer (Nelder_Mead) convergence code: 0 (OK)\nboundary (singular) fit: see help('isSingular')\n\n\n\n\nCódigo\nlibrary(DHARMa)\nplot(simulateResiduals(modelo))",
    "crumbs": [
      "Análisis Espacio-Temporal",
      "<span class='chapter-number'>3</span>  <span class='chapter-title'>Modelos lineales generalizados mixtos</span>"
    ]
  },
